## WNT structure extraction

### Purpose
To obtain the isolated WNT protein structure for subsequent three-dimensional structural comparison.

### Input
Original PDB structure files containing WNT and other structural components.

### Processing
The structures were processed in PyMOL. Chain A was identified as the WNT protein chain. 
All structural components other than Chain A were removed, and the remaining Chain A structure was exported as an independent PDB file.

Example PyMOL workflow:

```pymol
load WTwnt3-6AHY-human.pdb
remove not chain A
save WTwnt3.pdb

load WTwnt3a-7DRT-human.pdb
remove not chain A
save WTwnt3a.pdb

load WTwnt7a-8TZP-human.pdb
remove not chain A
save WTwnt7a.pdb

save aswnt1.pdb aswnt2.pdb aswnt3.pdb aswnt4.pdb aswnt5.pdb aswnt6.pdb aswnt7.pdb WTwnt3.pdb WTwnt3a.pdb WTwnt7a.pdb WTwnt7b-human.pdb in File 需要对比PDB.file

### Output
Processed PDB files containing only the WNT Chain A structure.
